        I had an idea which I think might be useful. Don't you think
it would be nice to have a selctive pickup option? For example, the
option could be set to only pickup gold, which would be handy in a
treasure zoo. Items that are selected to be picked up could be shown
in the discoveries section with a * beside the name. For example, the
listing

Amulets
* amulet of life saving (square)
* unknown
Armor
 cloak of displacement (piece of cloth)
 gauntlets of dexterity (riding gloves)
* speed boots (jungle boots)
 unknown
Gems
 dilithium crystal (white)
 diamond (white)
 ruby (red)
 sapphire (blue)
 unknown
Potions
*potion of gain ability (ruby)
 unknown
Scrolls
 scroll of taming (FOOBIE BLETCH)
 scroll called enchant armor (THARR)
*unknown
Wands
*wand of wishing (balsa)
 unknown

Food
*tins
 corpses
 rations
*Gold



would signify that all unknown amulets as well as the amulet of life saving,
speed boots, unknown scrolls, wands of wishing, tins, and gold will be
selectively picked up, while the everything else must be picked up manually.


I think this could be easily included in the next version of the game.

Wadda y'all think?

